Now, we are ready to write a test for the home page! This test verifies that the home URL
returns a successful HTTP result and that the home page contains a link to the package
management page, which is the /ManagePackages relative link.
It is fundamental to understand that automatic tests must not depend on the details of the
HTML, but that they must verify just logical facts, in order to avoid frequent changes after
each small modification of the application HTML. That's why we just verify that the needed
links exist without putting constraints on where they are.
